*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0048
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 870
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0048.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 TM-MM              PIC 9(3).
       88 TM-BAND-1-6 VALUE 1 THRU 6.
       88 TM-BAND-13-60 VALUE 13 THRU 60.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 WS-IRT             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "WS-IRT=" WS-IRT
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TM-BAND-1-6
            MOVE 0.0275 TO WS-IRT
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TM-MM >= 7 AND TM-MM <= 12
            MOVE 0.0350 TO WS-IRT
        *> LONG TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN TM-BAND-13-60
            MOVE 0.0425 TO WS-IRT
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0200 TO WS-IRT
    END-EVALUATE.
